        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: About Schmidt\n- People: Alexander Payne, Michael Besman, Harry Gittes, Rachael Horovitz, Jim Taylor, Rolfe Kent, Jack Nicholson\n- Roles: writer, director, producer, co-writer, composer, actor\n- Topics: film, film score composition\n\nFacts:\n- About Schmidt is a 2002 American comedy-drama film.\n- Alexander Payne wrote and directed About Schmidt.\n- Michael Besman, Harry Gittes, and Rachael Horovitz produced About Schmidt.\n- Jim Taylor co-wrote About Schmidt.\n- Rolfe Kent composed the music for About Schmidt.\n- Jack Nicholson starred in About Schmidt in the title role.\n- Rolfe R. Kent, born in 1963, is a British film score composer.",
